      "id": "claim_130a2f5fc40c46d3ab112bd5ee787812",
      "statement": "docker-entrypoint.sh is installed as /usr/local/bin/pi-entrypoint and is the agent image's ENTRYPOINT, with CMD pi, so the mode and agent arguments that bin/pi passes after the service name reach the script as \"$@\".",
